  m_Name: Cousin_m3_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: I was thinking about joining the soccer team next year.
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: Would you be willing to show me a thing or two to get a head start?
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: It would be great to start learning from someone as talented as you.
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Awesome! I won\u2019t let you down I promise."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019ll be sure to train as hard as I can so that I can be just
        as good as you someday."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Sure, I\u2019d be down to help you out at any time."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019m willing to put in the work."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019ll play in the championship and bring home a trophy as big
        as yours, you\u2019ll see!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: It is going to be a lot of hard work you know.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I know, but I\u2019m willing to put in the work."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019ll play in the championship and bring home a trophy as big
        as yours, you\u2019ll see!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "You\u2019ll have to make a lot of sacrifices if you want to
      bring home the trophy as well."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Awesome! I won\u2019t let you down I promise."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019ll be sure to train as hard as I can so that I can be just
        as good as you someday."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I barely made the team my first year. I can definitely give you
      some tips and tricks.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh... Alright. I guess you are right.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I should just stay in my lane and play my games.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Maybe I can be a streamer or something haha.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know if you\u2019ve got the make for it."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh... Alright. I guess you are right.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I should just stay in my lane and play my games.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Maybe I can be a streamer or something haha.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I dunno, it might be better to play more to your strengths. You
      should find something that you really like to do.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -15
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Of course! I\u2019ll follow everything you say to the letter."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Anything to be as good as good as you someday.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Hmm, I\u2019ve got the time. You ready to learn from the master?"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I know I am. I am ready to challenge myself to step out of my comfort
        zone and try something new.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: And I know you can give the best tips on how to succeed.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Are you sure you would be up for it?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Yeah, I know it will be a ton of work but I am ready.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I want to make a name for myself in middle school and putting a trophy
        on the shelves would be a good way to do it.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae4ec5c1a4d2a7f4388624996d3dcf02, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know, It takes a lot of determination and dedication
      you know. You think you will be able to?"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
